    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**SHOWHOUSE FOR SALE-ALL CONTENTS INCLUDED**\r\n\r\nNo. 2 Churchgate is our 4 bedroom showhouse, elegantly designed and finished by the Shauna Kelly Interiors, this luxury family home, comes to the market in pristine condition and with every conceivable extra required. All you need is your clothes and you can call No. 2 your home.\r\n\r\n. The location of Churchgate cannot be underestimated, with it’s proximity to Clonsilla Train Station along with all the\r\nmodern conveniences that Clonsilla and the wider area has to offer. Including numerous eateries, pubs, and shopping amenities all within a short distance from the development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "4 bedrooms"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "KITCHENS\r\n\r\n• Modern painted kitchen by BeSpace\r\n• Two styles depending on house type\r\n• Contemporary quartz top.\r\n• Kitchen island unit with integrated dishwasher \r\n• Selection of various height cabinetry in the\r\nutility room where possible\r\n\r\nINTERNAL - STANDARD FINISHES\r\n• All walls and ceilings will be dry lined and skimmed\r\n• 9ft ceiling heights to the ground floor\r\n• “Shaker” primed one panel door with a Capri chrome lever on rose handle\r\n• Modern Fireplace and Hearth -\r\nTwo styles depending on the house type\r\n• 22” Evonic Fireplace\r\n• Insulated and floored attic space\r\n\r\nBATHROOMS & ENSUITES\r\n• High quality SONAS sanitary ware throughout\r\n• Slimline shower trays, doors and screens\r\n• Luxury bath with mixer handset\r\n• Wall and floor tiles in main bathroom and ensuite as per showhouse\r\n• Heated towel rails fitted in main bathroom and ensuite\r\n\r\nMechanical & Electrical\r\n\r\nELECTRICAL\r\n• Well designed and generous electrical and\r\nlighting specification\r\n• Smoke, carbon monoxide detectors and\r\nheat sensor fitted as standard\r\n• Brushed chrome sockets to the ground floor\r\n• Ample sockets throughout\r\nHEATING & VENTILATION\r\n• Air to water heat pump\r\n• Heat recovery ventilation system\r\n• Pressurised water system with variable\r\nspeed pump\r\n• Modern compact radiators\r\n\r\nExternal\r\n\r\nCONSTRUCTION\r\n• Ibstock and Outhaus brick facades\r\n• Condron Concrete roof files\r\n• Off white double gazed PVC windows\r\nare supplied by Sean Doyle Windows\r\n• Solid core engineered composite front door\r\npanel with grain definition.\r\n• Excellent levels of insulation\r\n• Post box and house number\r\n\r\nGardens\r\nRear gardens are levelled and seeded\r\n\r\nProperty Guarantee\r\n10-year Homebound Guarantee\r\n\r\nBER\r\nA2"
      },
      {
